WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.430
Hi! I'm Julia. Let me tell you about my trip to Italy!

2
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:10.549
Last month, I traveled to Italy with my sister.

3
00:00:10.999 --> 00:00:13.506
We stayed there for two weeks.

4
00:00:15.756 --> 00:00:21.933
First, we visited Rome. We saw the Colosseum, and we walked a lot!

5
00:00:24.183 --> 00:00:29.523
The food was amazing. I ate pizza and ice cream every day!

6
00:00:31.773 --> 00:00:36.510
Then we traveled to Venice by train. We loved the gondolas!

7
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.915
In Florence, I met an old friend from school, and I bought a nice bag.

8
00:00:44.365 --> 00:00:47.105
It was the best trip of my life!

9
00:00:49.355 --> 00:00:52.281
And you? Tell me about your last trip!

